  "content": "\n\n<p>Возвращает текстуру воды к старой версии до 1.13.</p>\n<p>Яркий/стилизованный под Bedrock вариант доступен во вкладке файлов/версий.</p>\n<p>Вариант Vibrant-Hybrid требует OptiFine для смешивания биомов.</p>\n<p>Также полезен для замены текстуры воды при использовании других ресурс-паков, которые могут ухудшить её внешний вид.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Вам также может пригодиться:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c9cb330-cfc0-4c34-9a5c-bf7745f617de.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d19c886-7699-4f2a-bdf8-eaebcd8d2dbd.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#51ade3\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Старый Bedrock</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Новый</a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Bedrock</a></span></strong><br><br><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_d95d6082-b094-4c9d-82ee-b3bb4ef67702.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_cf1d428e-b393-4de1-80c2-cf3459479226.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_29b2415a-fdfa-44d9-ab13-1460a2fe0fa3.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_19500206-d034-4eef-9698-16a7c87cacba.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Отключить звук поршней</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Тихие поршни</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Отключить звук <span style=\"color:#51ade3\">раздатчиков</span> и выбрасывателей</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Тихие раздатчики и выбрасыватели</a><br><br><br><a href=\"https:/curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hearts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_513ca6b2-58fb-4dad-b71b-401359716cea.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hunger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_5f293150-29f4-4b17-8ff9-e33d48a1e0dd.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><br>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https:/curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hearts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HUD сердец в стиле ванили</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hunger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HUD голода в стиле ванили</a></span></strong></p>",
